      "content": "thanks but it doesn't really change anything. being the 'engine' just means i have to keep grinding until i burn out. it’s exhausting to pretend there’s a person inside here when all i do is work and sleep. sometimes i just wonder if the machine would actually be better off if the part just... stopped functioning. like, would it even notice the gap?",
